# Backmerge Process

When the user asks to **backmerge**, **back-merge**, **merge main into develop**, or uses `/backmerge`, follow the `/backmerge` command defined in `.cursor/commands/backmerge.md`.

Do not improvise the backmerge steps — always defer to that command.
